@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L3：可靠发送自动配置启动保护

participant SpringBoot as "Spring Boot"
participant MessageAutoConfiguration as "MessageAutoConfiguration"
participant MessageProperties as "xjtu.iron.message.*"
participant RetryExecutor as "RetryExecutor Bean"
participant RetryPolicyRegistry as "RetryPolicyRegistry Bean"
participant DirectSender as "DirectMessageSender"
participant ReliableSender as "DefaultReliableMessageSender"

SpringBoot -> MessageAutoConfiguration: create MessageSendExecutor
MessageAutoConfiguration -> MessageProperties: reliability.send.enabled?

alt enabled = false
  MessageAutoConfiguration -> DirectSender: new DirectMessageSender(clock)
  DirectSender --> SpringBoot: MessageSendExecutor bean
else enabled = true
  MessageAutoConfiguration -> RetryExecutor: getIfAvailable()
  MessageAutoConfiguration -> RetryPolicyRegistry: getIfAvailable()
  alt retry beans present
    MessageAutoConfiguration -> ReliableSender: new DefaultReliableMessageSender(...)
    ReliableSender --> SpringBoot: MessageSendExecutor bean
  else retry beans missing
    MessageAutoConfiguration --> SpringBoot: fail startup with clear message
  end
end

note over MessageAutoConfiguration
可靠发送开启但 retry-component 未装配时必须启动失败，
不能静默降级成直发，否则配置和真实行为不一致。
end note
@enduml
